### Start the other approval web app, then send this request to see e2e approval flow
POST http://localhost:7123/api/Entrypoint
Content-Type: text/plain
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: VSHttpClient/1.0

I want to test approval workflow. Create a new arbitrary operation with random operation ID and random resource ID. Then get new approval for it. Once you have a approval or rejection, message me with the result.
